#: src/memory-management/clone.md:6
msgid "Clone"
msgstr ""

#: src/memory-management/clone.md:8
msgid ""
"Sometimes you _want_ to make a copy of a value. The `Clone` trait "
"accomplishes this."
msgstr ""

